; For VW Golf V (1K), VW Touran (1T), VW Caddy (2K), Seat Altea (5P) and Skoda II (1Z), no guaranties
Byte 00 Bit 0 Fog light installed
Byte 00 Bit 1 Xenon head lights with shutter installed
Byte 00 Bit 2 Footwell light installed
Byte 00 Bit 3 Daytime driving lights (Scandinavia) - Lights on together with Ignition
Byte 00 Bit 4 Daytime driving lights (North America) - Lights on when Handbrake is Off (No parkinglight!)
Byte 00 Bit 5 Assistance driving light with Leaving Home (Sensor in backmirror) together with Byte 00 Bit 7 "Coming Home"
Byte 00 Bit 6 Rain-/Light sensor installed
Byte 00 Bit 7 Coming-Home installed
Byte 01 Bit 0 Rear seat recognition installed
Byte 01 Bit 1 Front Head light washer installed
Byte 01 Bit 2 Electronic fuelpump relay installed (fx. Engine BGU/BAG/AXW/AXX)
Byte 01 Bit 3 Rear wiper installed
Byte 01 Bit 4 Heated side mirror installed
Byte 01 Bit 5 Rear hatch remote opening
Byte 01 Bit 6 Rear hatch remote opening allowed - active
Byte 01 Bit 7 Rear Wiper active when driving backwards with continuesly wiper in front
Byte 02 Bit 0 Rear Wiper active when driving backwards with intermit wiper in front
Byte 02 Bit 1 Automatic turn signal on Highway when changing lane (press turn signal arm light)
Byte 02 Bit 2 Cold lamp diagnostics (no light on) (mandatory)
Byte 02 Bit 3 Loadmanagement (mandatory)
Byte 02 Bit 4 Coming-Home Mode by		(0 = Adaption / 1 = Potentiometer)
Byte 02 Bit 5 Rear lid remote openening	(0 = impuls activated / 1 = contact activated)
Byte 02 Bit 6 Side turn signal lights installed
Byte 02 Bit 7 Seat heating installed
Byte 03 Bit 0 Relay pin 15 inside installed
Byte 03 Bit 1 Rear fog light active		(0 = 2 rear fog lights / 1 = 1 rear fog lights)
Byte 03 Bit 2 Reverse driving light active	(0 = 2 reverse driving lights / 1 = 1 reverse driving lights)
Byte 03 Bit 3 Reverse driving light switched off when rear lid is open
Byte 03 Bit 4 Xenon head lights without shutter installed
Byte 03 Bit 5 Rear Wiper on, one time after normal wiper cycle (drip function)
Byte 03 Bit 6 Second battery installed
Byte 03 Bit 7 Rear light activation		(0 = rear light dimmed / 1= rear light/Brake light dimmed)
Byte 04 Bit 0 Cabinheater installed
Byte 04 Bit 1 Extra airheater installed
Byte 04 Bit 2 Trailer Connection Unit installed
Byte 04 Bit 3 Electrical seat adjustment with memory
Byte 04 Bit 4 Activation of both rear fog lights installed
Byte 04 Bit 5 0 = Right hand drive (PR-L0R) / 1 = Left hand drive (PR-L0L)
Byte 04 Bit 6 Rear fog light not active
Byte 04 Bit 7 Automatic airconditioning installed
Byte 05 Bit 0 Front light cleaning delay - Resolution 50ms
Byte 05 Bit 1 - Decimal value multiply resolution
Byte 05 Bit 2 - For example: Byte decimal value: 20 is 20 x 50 = 1000 ms
